{"about_the_game":"\u2018Match, Talk, Date!\u2019 is a modern take on the classic dating sim genre, where you use a dating app to chat to a diverse cast of unique characters and eventually ask them to go out on a date with you! Play how you want and date who you want, both men and women are available! <br><br>Can you convince them to go out on a date with you, or are you going home alone?<br><br><strong>Wishlist now!</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Steampage_Seperator.png?t=1740688681\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Steampage_Match.png?t=1740688681\" /><br><strong>Customize your dating profile and receive matches from your potential dating partners.</strong> The game will use this information to customize conversations to your preferences!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Match.gif?t=1740688681\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Steampage_Talk.png?t=1740688681\" /><br>Have meaningful conversations where you get to know the person behind the dating profile.<br><br><strong>You decide what chat messages to send and how the conversation goes.</strong> But be wary, the entire conversation will change not only depending on what you say, but also what you said in the past and the current situation!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Talk.gif?t=1740688681\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Steampage_DATE.png?t=1740688681\" /><br><strong>Prepare a gift, pick the perfect outfit and select the ideal location all to create the perfect date for your partner!</strong><br>But that\u2019s just the first step\u2026 because this time you don't have endless time to think about what to say!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Date.gif?t=1740688681\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Steampage_Andsomuchmore.png?t=1740688681\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Misc.gif?t=1740688681\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Steampage_Seperator.png?t=1740688681\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/Steampage_Features.png?t=1740688681\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  \u2764 Talk to a diverse cast of characters each with their own personality!<br></li><li>  \u2764 Date who you want. Men, women, both? There is something for everyone!<br></li><li>  \u2764 Extensive conversation system that shapes itself to the player and situation.<br></li><li>  \u2764 Create and shape your own characters with the character creation tools.<br></li><li>  \u2764 Bonus minigames. Everyone likes minigames right?<br></li><li>  \u2764 Customize your virtual phone. Cute stickers and more!<br></li><li>  \u2764 Optional nudity! Play how you want.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1482660?t=1740688681","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1482660?t=1740688681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/7830517011dba1737d2c6246b2537f53196bd00b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740688681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/7830517011dba1737d2c6246b2537f53196bd00b/cap